          "_name": "gallery09",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery09\" group=\"Gallery & Slider\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Gallery</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Captions\">\n    <select title=\"Image Width\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"4\">Narrow</option>\n      <option value=\"6\" selected>Wide</option>\n    </select>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffe6c3\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 main-text\">\n        <div class>\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>3D Modelling</b></p></h5>\n          <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">A Helicopter model made in blender.<br><br> For other 3D models by me, refer to my older games: The Adventure of Whisp &amp; Omo, Jungle Drive and Robo Rampage. The majority of models in these games were made by me in Blender.<br><br>My later projects had me focusing on other areas of game dev, instead of self produced 3D assets.</h6>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3 main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n            <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features row\">\n        \n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/heli1-1141x830.png-754x592.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>Innovation</b>\n              </h5>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/heli-2-944x717.png-944x717.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>Support</b>\n              </h5>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
